Wild OS icons for Write and Tables

svg/ holds the icons drawn on the Wild OS design boards for Write and Tables
(Paste, Cut, Copy, the text and paragraph buttons, Picture, Table, Find,
Replace, Sort, Filter, Chart, AutoSum, the sidebar strip) and the ones drawn
for Wild OS in the same style.

lucide/ holds icons from Lucide 1.71.0 (https://lucide.dev), unchanged
except that tools/gen-icons.py draws them with the boards' 1.8 stroke and
Wild OS colours. Lucide is under the ISC licence, with the icons it took
from Feather under the MIT licence; both are in lucide/LICENSE.
